# omp-ui_vault_write — omp-ui_vault_write

Create or append to a note in the omp-ui/ folder of the user's Obsidian knowledge vault; omp-ui stamps provenance frontmatter and links the note from the project's index note.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  mode: "create" | "append";
  /** Note title, which becomes the file name: omp-ui/<title>.md. No slashes. */
  title: string;
  /** Markdown body without frontmatter. On append, the text added at the end. */
  content: string;
  /** Optional tags such as decision, lesson, write-up. */
  tags?: string[];
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://omp-ui_vault_write.

